# Derived Learning Layer snapshot — regenerated from the campaigns after
# every review (see pipeline/services/learning/learn.ts). The campaigns in
# content-vault/campaigns/ are the source of truth; committing this file
# would just create churn and conflicts over data that recomputes itself.
# Leading slash is load-bearing: an unanchored "learning/" would also match
# pipeline/services/learning/ and silently exclude that source directory.
/learning/
